OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric manor to be transformed
OL,4,Ainto luxury hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 500-year-old manor house described as
OL,7,F"not suitable for modern living" is to
OL,8,Fbe converted into a luxury hotel.
OL,10,FThe new owners of Hazelbury Manor, at
OL,11,FBox in Wiltshire, have been given
OL,12,Fpermission by Wiltshire Council to
OL,13,Fchange the use of the Grade I listed
OL,14,Fbuilding from residential to
OL,15,Fhospitality.
OL,17,FAgents representing the owners said the
OL,18,Fproperty's "long corridors", multiple
OL,19,Fcourtyards and "extensive floorspace"
OL,20,Fmade it unsuitable for "modern living"
OL,21,Fbut "entirely appropriate for use as a
OL,22,Fhotel".
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
