OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric manor to be transformed
OL,4,Ainto luxury hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe change of use application was
OL,7,Frecommended for approval by planning
OL,8,Fofficers, as an "appropriate and
OL,9,Fviable" way of securing the "long-term
OL,10,Fconservation" of the manor house and
OL,11,Fgrounds.
